  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, cook the couscous according to package instructions.",
    "Thread the cherry tomatoes, cucumber, and red onion onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the skewers with the garlic and lemon mixture.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until the vegetables are tender.",
    "To serve, place the grilled skewers on a hot stone plate, and top with cooked couscous and chopped parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
